          .proof
            %h6#proof Proof
            %p
              (
              %a{:href => "#RiehlVerity14"}> Riehl &amp; Verity 2014, Lemma 4.8
              )
          %p
            The following related property is also observed at
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Joyal-Tierney+calculus"} Joyal-Tierney calculus
