          %p
          #PushoutProductAxiomInCofibrantlyGeneratedModelCategories.num_remark
            %h6 Remark
            %p
              In the context of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monoidal+model+category"} monoidal model category
              theory, prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#PushoutProductOfCofClassIsCofClassOfPushoutProduct"}
              implies that for checking the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pushout-product+axiom"} pushout-product axiom
              in the case of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cofibrantly+generated+model+categories"} cofibrantly generated model categories
              it is sufficient to check it on
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generating+cofibrations"} generating cofibrations
