          %p
          #PushoutProductOfMapsOfSets.num_remark
            %h6 Example
            %p
              The pushout-product of sets may be described as the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quotient+set"} quotient set
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
